# Frigate. Objectives (tools/bot/objectives.py assets/obseg/setup/u/UsetupdestZ.c):
#   0 rescue the hostages: one flag per hostage (0x100..0x1000); on Agent ai_11 sets 0x100, 0x200, 0x400 at the start,
#     so two escapes are needed. Fails on 0x100000 (more than 4 civilians killed).
#     A hostage (ai_1, list 0x402) waits until his captor (ai_2, list 0x403) is gone, then runs ai_3 (0x404): runs to a
#     random pad and, when he is there with NO line of sight to Bond, fades out and sets the next flag; with a line he
#     picks another pad and runs on. The captor shoots his hostage 3 s after he first has a line on Bond (the line test
#     ignores facing; also when Bond misses him) unless Bond has hit him by then (then he fights).
#   1 disarm the bomb on the bridge (SA+)   2 disarm the engine-room bomb (SA+)
#   3 plant the tracker bug on the helicopter (tag 0): 0x4000 once the bug (item 0x2f) is attached to it (all)
# The way out (ai_10): once Bond has left the rooms of pads 153 / 149 (the start), walking back into the room of pad 153
# ends the mission (all objectives done: the good ending).
name frigate
obj=3 gadget bug obj 0
obj=0 hunt ai 0x403
obj=0 hunt
auto
goto pad 153 60
exit
